tions | version: 3 · status: current · effective: 2026-04-01 · supersedes: HB-11\nGroup exceptions to the monthly parking allowance are published in HB-46. Each claim for the monthly parking allowance needs a receipt showing the date, the amount and the supplier. The facilities publishes worked examples of the monthly parking allowance on the intranet.\n[result-screen/1: kept 5 of 6 passages (2,181 of 2,581 chars); omitted HB-46 §1; unscreened: fetch(['HB-46 §1']) or /task/workspace/search-results/SR-006.txt]\n<<end search-result SR-006>>\n"
